RESEARCH USE ONLY NOTICE

This software is provided as a research tool for testing market microstructure
hypotheses. While comprehensive validation is included, trading decisions based
on this software should be:

1. Independently verified
2. Forward-tested on live data
3. Risk-managed with position sizing
4. Monitored for statistical validity

The authors make no guarantees about predictive accuracy or market performance.
Use entirely at your own risk.

